  <item>
    <title>09.散步、多重表皮和武康路</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/654318743c0b0c6de43c045a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">654318743c0b0c6de43c045a</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 02 Nov 2023 03:33:07 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>武康路和武康大楼，因为网络的传播，成为「上海知名景点之一」。其实除了跟建筑合影，这个街区还有不少地方和建筑细节值得你慢慢品读。这期，我们就带你云逛武康路，同时也探讨citytour的更多可能性。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="172">02:52</a> 武康路上的citytour。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a> 建筑风格的定义，基于遗产保护的研究。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="682">11:22</a> 城市是由“多重历史”的表皮构成。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1216">20:16</a> 思辨：相比当代艺术，建筑更容易被接触和理解。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1590">26:30</a> 多种多样的citytour的主题。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1882">31:22</a> 「走街串巷」系列路线，探索日常街区。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2025">33:45</a> 每周日上午11点，城市交集的小伙伴跟你讲述武康大楼的历史。</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>「城市可颂」是</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/i3q5hnZwxGNlncME7FnF_A" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/i3q5hnZwxGNlncME7FnF_A"><span>「日常建筑学」</span></a><span>推出的一档全新的播客节目。在这里，我们想和你一块聊聊柔软治愈的慢生活。</span></p><span></span><p><span>出品：日常建筑学</span></p><span></span><p><span>主持人：黄沛Halleywood</span></p><span></span><p><span>特约嘉宾：张琪、林昭宇</span></p><span></span><p><span>声音剪辑：啸飞</span></p><span></span><p><span>主题曲《Skyline》 编曲：Frank Wang</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>订阅号：日常建筑学（archi-loop）</span></p><span></span><p><span>网店：小红书检索#日常建筑学</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5b60074f4eacab60b643a8c4?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5b60074f4eacab60b643a8c4&amp;apptime=1697625805" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5b60074f4eacab60b643a8c4?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5b60074f4eacab60b643a8c4&amp;apptime=1697625805"><span>www.xiaohongshu.com</span></a></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/no52y1K7ZlxCnbPZBySKfJIr5JEe.mp3" length="50887139" type="audio/mpeg"/>
