  <item>
    <title>05.从《甄嬛传》说起，那些消暑的“冷知识”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64d393d880c9ec4c5fd110d6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64d393d880c9ec4c5fd110d6</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 09 Aug 2023 13:25:43 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>古代的人如何消暑？现代设计有什么“妙招”？第五期，我们就从所见所学，跟大家一块聊聊消暑的那些“冷知识”。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="144">02:24</a> 从《甄嬛传》说起，看古人如何避暑？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="425">07:05</a> 天然氧吧认证：好山好水好森林。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="948">15:48</a> 中国古代建筑的天井、凉巷、阁楼。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1221">20:21</a> 欧洲人是如何度过夏天的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1400">23:20</a> 设计创新：空调的发明促进了现代工业、Apple迪拜旗舰店的通风玻璃扇、麦地那广场的巨型阳伞。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1885">31:25</a> 聊聊夏日的清凉之法</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>「城市可颂」是</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/i3q5hnZwxGNlncME7FnF_A" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/i3q5hnZwxGNlncME7FnF_A"><span>「日常建筑学」</span></a><span>推出的一档全新的播客节目。在这里，我们想和你一块聊聊柔软治愈的慢生活。</span></p><span></span><p><span>出品：日常建筑学</span></p><span></span><p><span>主持人：黄沛Halleywood、王子佳Olivia</span></p><span></span><p><span>声音剪辑：黄沛</span></p><span></span><p><span>主题曲《Skyline》 编曲：Frank Wang</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>订阅号：日常建筑学（archi-loop）</span></p><span></span><p><span>网店：小红书检索#日常建筑学</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5b60074f4eacab60b643a8c4?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5b60074f4eacab60b643a8c4&amp;apptime=1697625805" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5b60074f4eacab60b643a8c4?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5b60074f4eacab60b643a8c4&amp;apptime=1697625805"><span>www.xiaohongshu.com</span></a></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lrMN-2sOlxrB2QuAYPfsoBUmfKLo.m4a" length="36108921" type="audio/mp4"/>
